        <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="namespacefccvis_1_1scene_1_1meta_1aff2f8169b31242b22ee2e21eb2ee106e" kindref="member">Color</ref> specification for visualization primitives. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="namespacefccvis_1_1scene_1_1meta_1aff2f8169b31242b22ee2e21eb2ee106e" kindref="member">Color</ref> provides a backend-independent enumeration of the colors available to scene primitives such as <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1scene_1_1meta_1_1Marker" kindref="compound">Marker</ref> and <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1scene_1_1meta_1_1Line" kindref="compound">Line</ref>.</para>
<para>In addition to explicit colors, the enumeration provides automatic color modes. The interpretation of automatic modes is performed by the visualization backend. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
