    <briefdescription>
<para>Metadata and graphical primitives for visualization scenes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Metadata and configuration objects for visualization scenes.</para>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacefccvis_1_1scene_1_1meta" kindref="compound">fccvis::scene::meta</ref></computeroutput> namespace contains the lightweight configuration objects used to describe how scenes are constructed and displayed.</para>
<para>These objects are primarily metadata rather than rendering objects. They can be composed into higher-level objects such as <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1scene_1_1Scene" kindref="compound">fccvis::scene::Scene</ref> and <ref refid="classfccvis_1_1session_1_1SessionOptions" kindref="compound">fccvis::session::SessionOptions</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
